  "strings": [
    "The Dark Lord must be pleased\u0000",
    "for a ruined city has once more been ground beneath the boot of the Orc.\u0000",
    "Faramir and all of his men are shown no mercy...\u0000",
    "nor did they expect to receive it.\u0000",
    "And for Sauron's hordes\u0000",
    "the road is again laid open into the heartland of Gondor.\u0000",
    "Now, within the camps of Mordor, the Dark Lord calls forth fresh legions.\u0000",
    "For this time he shall utterly crush those who dare stand against him.\u0000"
  ]
